ositions (right to left):\n\n1:5, 2:7, 3:7, 4:7, 5:3, 6:5, 7:6, 8:6, 9:6\n\nSecond number (338039615):\n\nPositions (right to left):\n\n1:5, 2:1, 3:6, 4:9, 5:3, 6:8, 7:0, 8:3, 9:3\n\nWait, hold on. Wait, the second number is 33,803,9615. Breaking it down:\n\n33,000,000 is 3 3 0 0 0 0 0 0 0\n\n803,000 is 0 0 8 0 3 0 0 0\n\n9,615 is 0 0 0 0 9 6 1 5\n\nSo when written as 338039615, the digits are 3 3 8 0 3 9 6 1 5. Therefore, positions (right to left):\n\n1:5, 2:1, 3:6, 4:9, 5:3, 6:8, 7:0, 8:3, 9:3\n\nWait, but that's not matching. Wait, 338039615:\n\nStarting from the right:\n\nDigit 1:5\n\nDigit 2:1\n\nDigit 3:6\n\nDigit 4:9\n\nDigit 5:3\n\nDigit 6:8\n\nDigit 7:0\n\nDigit 8:3\n\nDigit 9:3\n\nYes, that's correct.\n\nSo now, adding the two numbers digit by digit from right to left:\n\nPosition 1:5 +5=10 \u21920, carry 1\n\nPosition 2:7 +1=8 +1=9, carry 0\n\nPosition 3:7 +6=13 \u21923, carry 1\n\nPosition 4:7 +9=16 +1=17 \u21927, carry 1\n\nPosition 5:3 +3=6 +1=7, carry 0\n\nPosition 6:5 +8=13 \u21923, carry 1\n\nPosition 7:6 +0=6 +1=7, carry 0\n\nPosition 8:6 +3=9 +0=9, carry 0\n\nPosition 9:6 +3=9 +0=9, carry 0\n\nWait, hold on. Wait, this is different from before. Wait, now I'm getting a different result. Wait, what's happening here.\n\nWait, let me re-examine the positions. If the first number is 666537775, then the digits from right to left are:\n\nPosition 1:5\n\nPosition 2:7\n\nPosition 3:7\n\nPosition 4:7\n\nPosition 5:3\n\nPosition 6:5\n\nPosition 7:6\n\nPosition 8:6\n\nPosition 9:6\n\nAnd the second number is 338039615, digits from right to left:\n\nPosition 1:5\n\nPosition 2:1\n\nPosition 3:6\n\nPosition 4:9\n\nPosition 5:3\n\nPosition 6:8\n\nPosition 7:0\n\nPosition 8:3\n\nPosition 9:3\n\nSo adding them:\n\nPosition 1:5 +5=10 \u21920, carry 1\n\nPosition 2:7 +1=8 +1=9, carry 0\n\nPosition 3:7 +6=13 \u21923, carry 1\n\nPosition 4:7 +9=16 +1=17 \u21927, carry 1\n\nPosition 5:3 +3=6 +1=7, carry 0\n\nPosition 6:5 +8=13 \u21923, carry 1\n\nPosition 7:6 +0=6 +1=7,